  {
   "text": "Ashling, the Limitless received Day 0 functional errata , now only allowing you to evoke elemental permanent spells, instead of any spell with the elemental creature type. Additionally, the spells are now granted Evoke as they are being cast, making it impossible to prevent the sacrifice trigger by removing Ashling.",
   "scene": 22,
   "section": "Notable cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "In at least once case, Magic cards were misprinted with Pokémon energy symbols stamped upside down on the front.",
